\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ)\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\n$$\n\nEquating the coefficients of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,$ we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ=\\sqrt{2} \\\\ R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nDividing the second equation by the first, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ}{R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ} & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\operatorname{tan}⁡ϕ & =\\sqrt{2} \\\\ ϕ & =\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038530/state.json" "file_sha256" "b268fa94565c1db9deea58ee11f8fdf2750b0acf594557f8dfa6a48f0b6a47b2"} {"question" "q-107565" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038530/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "cab1d110fad91a5454cc07913f68c920bed3a02a2543671beb0be3c79578ed7e"} {"question" "q-107565" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038530/state.json" "file_sha256" "b268fa94565c1db9deea58ee11f8fdf2750b0acf594557f8dfa6a48f0b6a47b2"} {"question" "q-107565" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})"] ["math" "\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2})"] ["math" "\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{6})"] ["math" "{45}^{∘}"] ["math" "{60}^{∘}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14038530/state.json" "file_sha256" "b268fa94565c1db9deea58ee11f8fdf2750b0acf594557f8dfa6a48f0b6a47b2"} {"question" "q-107565" "